    {"content_id":"content-work-001","source_facts":{"original_text":"Företagsutveckling börjar inte i rapporten. Den börjar i verkligheten.","language":"sv","channel":"work_deck","publication_status":"unverified_draft_or_work_material","dates":{"source_created":"2026-07-16","verified_publication_date":null},"source":"Ledarskap utan filter. WORK LinkedIn, slide 1","publication_evidence":null},"analytical_enrichment":{"thesis_family_id":"thesis-reality-before-story-001","series_id":null,"territory_relation":null,"topic_labels":["verklighet","företagsutveckling"],"confidence":"strongly_supported"},"text_completeness":"full"},
    {"content_id":"content-work-002","source_facts":{"original_text":"Resultatet är fördröjd verklighet. Det vi ser i siffrorna idag började ofta långt tidigare. I ett samtal som aldrig hölls. I ett ansvar som var otydligt. I ett beteende som fick fortsätta.","language":"sv","channel":"work_deck","publication_status":"unverified_draft_or_work_material","dates":{"source_created":"2026-07-16","verified_publication_date":null},"source":"WORK LinkedIn, slide 2","publication_evidence":null},"analytical_enrichment":{"thesis_family_id":"thesis-symptom-cause-001","series_id":null,"territory_relation":null,"topic_labels":["resultat","ansvar","konsekvens"],"confidence":"strongly_supported"},"text_completeness":"full"},
    {"content_id":"content-work-003","source_facts":{"original_text":"De flesta företag behandlar symptomen. Låg lönsamhet. Konflikter. Kvalitetsbrister. Sjukfrånvaro. Personalomsättning. Viktiga signaler. Men sällan själva kärnan.","language":"sv","channel":"work_deck","publication_status":"unverified_draft_or_work_material","dates":{"source_created":"2026-07-16","verified_publication_date":null},"source":"WORK LinkedIn, slide 3","publication_evidence":null},"analytical_enrichment":{"thesis_family_id":"thesis-symptom-cause-001","series_id":"series-diagnosis-before-solution-001","territory_relation":null,"topic_labels":["symptom","orsak","organisation"],"confidence":"strongly_supported"},"text_completeness":"full"},
    {"content_id":"content-work-004","source_facts":{"original_text":"Vi söker det som skapade problemet. Symptom. Samband. Kärna. När kärnan blir synlig kan verksamheten förändras på riktigt.","language":"sv","channel":"work_deck","publication_status":"unverified_draft_or_work_material","dates":{"source_created":"2026-07-16","verified_publication_date":null},"source":"WORK LinkedIn, slide 4","publication_evidence":null},"analytical_enrichment":{"thesis_family_id":"thesis-symptom-cause-001","series_id":"series-diagnosis-before-solution-001","territory_relation":null,"topic_labels":["symptom","samband","förändring"],"confidence":"strongly_supported"},"text_completeness":"full"},
    {"content_id":"content-work-005","source_facts":{"original_text":"Trianglarna är punkterna. Trianguleringen är modellen. Tid. Kostnad. Kvalitet. Se. Höra. Känna. Struktur. Kultur. Mindset. En punkt ger en uppgift. Flera perspektiv ger en sannare bild.","language":"sv","channel":"work_deck","publication_status":"unverified_draft_or_work_material","dates":{"source_created":"2026-07-16","verified_publication_date":null},"source":"WORK LinkedIn, slide 5","publication_evidence":null},"analytical_enrichment":{"thesis_family_id":"thesis-reality-before-story-001","series_id":null,"territory_relation":null,"topic_labels":["triangulering","perspektiv","verklighet"],"confidence":"strongly_supported"},"text_completeness":"full"},
    {"content_id":"content-work-006","source_facts":{"original_text":"Observation före tolkning. Observation: Tre personer kom sent till mötet. Tolkning: De bryr sig inte. Problemet börjar när vi behandlar tolkningen som fakta. Se först. Förstå sedan.","language":"sv","channel":"work_deck","publication_status":"unverified_draft_or_work_material","dates":{"source_created":"2026-07-16","verified_publication_date":null},"source":"WORK LinkedIn, slide 6","publication_evidence":null},"analytical_enrichment":{"thesis_family_id":"thesis-reality-before-story-001","series_id":null,"territory_relation":null,"topic_labels":["observation","tolkning","möten"],"confidence":"strongly_supported"},"text_completeness":"full"},
    {"content_id":"content-work-007","source_facts":{"original_text":"Så flyttar vi verksamheten. Se. Förstå. Prioritera. Agera. Mäta. Korrigera. Mäta igen. En förändring är inte färdig när beslutet är fattat. Den är färdig när verkligheten har förändrats.","language":"sv","channel":"work_deck","publication_status":"unverified_draft_or_work_material","dates":{"source_created":"2026-07-16","verified_publication_date":null},"source":"WORK LinkedIn, slide 7","publication_evidence":null},"analytical_enrichment":{"thesis_family_id":"thesis-change-over-time-001","series_id":null,"territory_relation":null,"topic_labels":["förändring","uppföljning","beteende"],"confidence":"strongly_supported"},"text_completeness":"full"},
    {"content_id":"content-work-008","source_facts":{"original_text":"Fyra ord håller ihop förändringen. Verklighet: Våga se vad som faktiskt händer. Språk: Sätt gemensamma ord på det ni ser. Ansvar: Gör nästa handling och ägare tydliga. Konsekvens: Låt överenskommelser få betydelse.","language":"sv","channel":"work_deck","publication_status":"unverified_draft_or_work_material","dates":{"source_created":"2026-07-16","verified_publication_date":null},"source":"WORK LinkedIn, slide 8","publication_evidence":null},"analytical_enrichment":{"thesis_family_id":"thesis-change-over-time-001","series_id":null,"territory_relation":null,"topic_labels":["förändring","ansvar","konsekvens"],"confidence":"strongly_supported"},"text_completeness":"full"},
    {"content_id":"content-work-009","source_facts":{"original_text":"Människan först betyder inte resultatet sist. Resultat. Relation. Krav. Stöd. Tydlighet. Tillit. Bra ledarskap väljer inte sida. Det håller ihop helheten.","language":"sv","channel":"work_deck","publication_status":"unverified_draft_or_work_material","dates":{"source_created":"2026-07-16","verified_publication_date":null},"source":"WORK LinkedIn, slide 9","publication_evidence":null},"analytical_enrichment":{"thesis_family_id":"thesis-relation-results-001","series_id":null,"territory_relation":null,"topic_labels":["relation","resultat","tillit"],"confidence":"strongly_supported"},"text_completeness":"full"},
    {"content_id":"content-work-010","source_facts":{"original_text":"Katalysatorn gör det osynliga synligt. Ser mönster mellan avdelningar. Hör det som sägs mellan raderna. Ställer frågan organisationen slutat ställa. Inte för att skapa beroende. För att göra verksamheten starkare och mer självgående.","language":"sv","channel":"work_deck","publication_status":"unverified_draft_or_work_material","dates":{"source_created":"2026-07-16","verified_publication_date":null},"source":"WORK LinkedIn, slide 10","publication_evidence":null},"analytical_enrichment":{"thesis_family_id":"thesis-invisible-governs-001","series_id":null,"territory_relation":null,"topic_labels":["katalysator","undertext","mönster"],"confidence":"strongly_supported"},"text_completeness":"full"},
    {"content_id":"content-work-011","source_facts":{"original_text":"Om du ser problemet så äger du problemet. Det betyder inte att du måste lösa allt själv. Det betyder att du inte får gå förbi. Lyft frågan. Samla rätt människor. Be om hjälp. Men låt inte problemet växa i tystnad.","language":"sv","channel":"work_deck","publication_status":"unverified_draft_or_work_material","dates":{"source_created":"2026-07-16","verified_publication_date":null},"source":"WORK LinkedIn, slide 11","publication_evidence":null},"analytical_enrichment":{"thesis_family_id":"thesis-responsibility-not-passed-001","series_id":null,"territory_relation":null,"topic_labels":["ansvar","problem","tystnad"],"confidence":"strongly_supported"},"text_completeness":"full"},
    {"content_id":"content-work-012","source_facts":{"original_text":"Vad visar er verklighet innan det syns i siffrorna? Ett system för att se tidigare, förstå djupare och agera medan det fortfarande går att påverka.","language":"sv","channel":"work_deck","publication_status":"unverified_draft_or_work_material","dates":{"source_created":"2026-07-16","verified_publication_date":null},"source":"WORK LinkedIn, slide 12","publication_evidence":null},"analytical_enrichment":{"thesis_family_id":"thesis-reality-before-story-001","series_id":null,"territory_relation":null,"topic_labels":["tidiga signaler","verklighet","agerande"],"confidence":"strongly_supported"},"text_completeness":"full"},
